
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. BANKCALC.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01 WS-BALANCE PIC 9(6)V99 VALUE 5000.
       01 WS-DEPOSIT PIC 9(6)V99 VALUE 1500.
       01 WS-WITHDRAW PIC 9(6)V99 VALUE 800.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

           ADD WS-DEPOSIT TO WS-BALANCE.

           SUBTRACT WS-WITHDRAW
               FROM WS-BALANCE.

           DISPLAY 'FINAL BALANCE: ' WS-BALANCE.

           STOP RUN.
